/** Reads the CURRENT theme once, at the moment the caller needs an appearance
 *  object — a plain function, not a hook, because every consumer already only
 *  calls this from inside a client component that is about to construct
 *  Stripe Elements, never during SSR (Elements needs a clientSecret that is
